# QuillArrow Clio API Orchestrator

FastAPI backend + Vite/React SPA, hosted on Azure App Service, data in Azure SQL, talking to Clio Manage API v4. Frontend build is served from `frontend/dist` by the same FastAPI process.

## Where truth lives

- Product and architecture docs: `docs/` (also the Obsidian vault). Start at `docs/THREAD_HANDOFF.md` and `docs/00_Home.md`.
- Do not dump the vault into every reply. Link the relevant page.
- `Misc_Docs/` is an archive, gitignored, not source of truth.

## Hard constraints

- Azure front-end gateway times out at ~230s. Preview, execute, revert, and billing refresh must be background jobs (`backend/routes/_bulk_jobs.py` or the billing job pattern). HTTP returns quickly; the UI polls.
- Closing a browser tab does **not** cancel a job. Cancellation is cooperative (`POST /api/execute/jobs/{id}/cancel`) and execute cancel must roll back applied rows.
- A deploy/restart kills in-process threads. Do not treat that as a user cancel.
- Never write exploits, attack PoCs, or Clio credential dumps.

## Thread hygiene

One Cursor thread ≈ one outcome. Do not re-summarize the whole project unless asked.
